\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterStone} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
耶和華的\textbf{\color{HandClay!80!black}榮光}從朝\textbf{\color{HandClay!80!black}東}的門照入殿中。……
耶和華的榮光\textbf{\color{HandClay!80!black}充滿}了殿。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
And the glory of the LORD came into the house by the way of the gate facing toward the
\textbf{east}. … And behold, the glory of the LORD \textbf{filled} the house.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterStone} 以西結書 43:4-5 \textperiodcentered\ Ezekiel 43:4-5
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 四十八章經文 \textperiodcentered\ 三十四篇研讀 \textperiodcentered\ 六卷 \textperiodcentered\ 榮耀先離開，也先回來\\
\textit{Forty-eight chapters of Ezekiel in thirty-four studies \textperiodcentered\ six volumes \textperiodcentered\ the glory departs first and returns first}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{2.9cm}p{1.9cm}p{7.3cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{卷} & \textbf{研讀篇} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
卷一：榮耀臨到被擄之地 & 1-3篇 & 榮耀在河邊、在沒有殿的地方向被擄者顯現；先看見，才吃書卷，才受託守望 \\
卷二：榮耀離開 & 4-8篇 & 不說話的記號；殿裏的穢像；榮耀在城破之前，一站一站離開 \\
卷三：審判的理由 & 9-18篇 & 假平安、偶像在心、棄嬰的身世、各人的罪、悖逆的歷史、流血的城、兩姊妹、鍋 \\
卷四：列國也要知道 & 19-23篇 & 「知道我是耶和華」從以色列擴到鄰邦、推羅、埃及 \\
卷五：口開了，神自己來 & 24-29篇 & 消息到之前口先開；神自己作牧人；新心新靈；枯骨復活；歌革 \\
卷六：榮耀回來 & 30-34篇 & 度量；榮耀從東而來；君王與土地；殿中流出的水；耶和華的所在 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterStone} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一卷奇異的異象書，是來看榮耀的路徑：先在被擄之地顯現（1:28），在城破之前離開殿（11:23），最後從離開的那個方向回來（43:2）。\\
書中最常重複的一句是「他們就知道我是耶和華」，它出現在審判與復興之中，卻不在異象的開頭與結尾。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not reading a catalogue of strange visions but following a path: the glory
appears first among the exiles (1:28), leaves the temple before the city falls (11:23),
and returns from the very direction it left (43:2).}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

